      <div type="clause" n="10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And æghwilc Cristen man unriht hæmed georne forbuge ⁊ godcunde laga rihtlice healde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And all Christian men shall carefully avoid illicit unions, and duly observe the laws of the church.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And æghwylc Cristen man eac unriht hæmed georne forbuge ⁊ godcunde laga rihtlice healde.</ab>
